    ('def palindrome_check(s):\n    s = s.lower().replace(" ", "")\n    return s == s[::-1]',
     '段落 回文检查 接收 s：\n    设 s 为 s.lower().replace(" ", "")\n    返回 s 等于 s[::-1]'),
